Fixtures produced by the real toolchain, not by this package.

testkey.pub / testkey.sec
    Keypair generated with `gosignify -G`. Passphrase: hunter2.
    Used to exercise sign/verify round trips.

other.pub
    An unrelated public key, for key-mismatch cases.

plakar-dist.pub
    The live PlakarKorp package-signing public key.

recipe.yaml, recipe.yaml.sum, recipe.yaml.sum.sig
    Fetched from plakar.io/dist. Signed by plakar-dist.pub, embedded.
    These fail if this package stops agreeing with signify(1) itself.
